## Why a message has not gone out (one line under its subject)

outbox-not-sent = Ba a aika ba saboda { $reason }.
outbox-retrying = Ba a aika ba tukuna saboda { $reason }. Katna za ta sake gwadawa da kanta.
outbox-waiting-sign-in = Ana jiran ku sake shiga { $address }. Zai fita a lokacin.
outbox-waiting-password = Ana jiran sabuwar kalmar sirrin { $address }. Zai fita a lokacin.
outbox-waiting-connection = Ana jiran haɗi. Zai fita idan kun sake haɗuwa.

